  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "This is the last wave of pursuers!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "...Aaargh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "All clear!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Confirming that it's safe over here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Where's the enemy commander?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "...Not with their main force.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "The enemy is lurking... we're being followed and watched.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Are they trying to wear us down until they have the perfect opportunity to strike?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Reunion is no stranger to sneak attacks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We learned this the hard way at Chernobog.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Let's fall back quickly...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "I can't guarantee the safety of the escape route.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "We'll be in danger if they start demolishing the nearby buildings to block the road.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Hurry, let's see what other routes we can take. The stealthier, the better!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Amiya, how about taking that staircase to our 4 o'clock down?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "That's a difficult route.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Aaargh! Rhodes Island!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "It's an ambush! Watch out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Continue the chase.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Don't give them any room to breathe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Madam...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "There are some Infected kids... still in the slums.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "If possible...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I hope that you can take care of them...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Our duty is to protect Lungmen.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "The Infected are not considered citizens of Lungmen.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "However, citizens or not, the Infected still belong to Lungmen.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "I have no obligation to promise you anything, but I will perform my duty.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "After all...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "They said they used to...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "="
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "It's something we've always been doing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Thank you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Do you know why we've been searching for you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...I'm not sure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I can't think of any reason why you'd want me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "But I have a feeling...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "That this isn't about me...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...It's about my parents.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...Yes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Your father was the most famous scientist in Chernobog.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "As well as one of the most important political figures there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Perhaps, there's something you might know...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "But even if that isn't the case...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "We cannot allow you to fall into Reunion's hands.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Hehe. I've found you, L.G.D.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Don't take this personally...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "But I have a very interesting plot in my hands.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "To make things more entertaining, I'll need you all to participate.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Now, let us begin.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
